    "Name": "Scorpion",
    "Details": "Not to be confused with the similarly-named failed SCP-X1, this <i>Scorpion</i> model also never made it beyond the prototyping stages before the high production costs and overall unpopularity of the chassis saw it scrapped.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>",
